#Deploy-agent Project

This is project is about a developing a deployment tool for a student attedance tracker app

## Purpose

the designed `deploy_agent.sh` script will automatically deploy, run, and archive its attendance logs the attendance-project everytime the user wants to take a new attendance 

## Templates files

the templates folder contains the source code files for the student attendance tracker app, the files include 

- attendance_checker.py
- assets.csv
- config.json

the deploy_agent.sh script will copy these templates files into a newly created project folder with the `Helpers` and `reports` direcotries to as the required project structure to enable the app the run smoothly 

## Deployment feature

Feature 1- currently working on the deployment feature and pre-flight checks
